# Oxide above the heater stores heat but leads nowhere when the top is adiabatic.
# Reference: the same mesh solved with a sparse direct solver in SciPy.
title Cladding up to 4.5 um
grid dx=0.25 dy=0.25
window width=60 ymin=-10 ymax=4.5
layer si -10 0
layer sio2 0 4.5
rect si -0.25 0.25 2 2.25
rect tin -1 1 4 4.25
heater h xmin=-1 xmax=1 ymin=4 ymax=4.25 power=0.1
probe wg xmin=-0.25 xmax=0.25 ymin=2 ymax=2.25
expect response wg h 185.522912 1e-7
expect pi_power wg h 22.4590409 1e-7
expect peak 45.6044302 1e-7
expect balance 1e-9
expect cells 13920
